---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | StudyPath"><main class="container py-14"><a class="text-sm font-bold text-teal-700" href={base}>← Back to StudyPath</a><article class="surface mt-6 p-7 md:p-10"><h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold">Privacy Policy</h1><p class="muted mt-5 max-w-4xl leading-8">StudyPath stores shortlist, checklist and planning preferences only in your current browser. The initial version does not provide accounts, cloud synchronisation or document uploads. Browser storage can be removed by clearing site data. GitHub Pages may process technical request information under its own policies. Read the <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub Privacy Statement</a>. External websites and your email provider have separate privacy policies. Do not enter passport numbers, bank details, passwords or sensitive personal information.</p></article></main></BaseLayout>